<title>USA: U.S. Xpress names Ray Harlin CFO.</title>
<headline>U.S. Xpress names Ray Harlin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Xpress Enterprises Inc said Friday it named Ray Harlin as chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Harlin replaces Larry Bentley, who resigned in August.</p>
<p>U.S. Xpress said Harlin joins the company after a 25-year career with Arthur Andersen LLP, the accounting firm, where he was most recently managing partner for Chattanooga.</p>
<p>U.S. Xpress is a road hauler that specializes in time-definite and expedited truckload services, such as those required by air freight shippers.</p>
